    "text": "myleaderpaper.com\nwebsite\nJefferson County, Missouri\nCounty cancels agreement as it audits subdivisions in street maintenance program\nBy Abby Stetina,\n3 hours agoIt looks like the Jefferson County Public Works Department is terminating a road maintenance agreement with Valley Oaks, a subdivision off Seckman Road in Imperial. The department decided to terminate that agreement after completing its first audit of the county’s street maintenance program, Public Works Director Jason Jonas said.",
